; A labelled tuple whose labels name no parameter list of the routine it is
; applied to is rc 4 (2026-10-19, Planner.report_unmatched_labels#) -- by
; position it would hand each component to whatever stands there.
; xfail: the labels of the tuple (w, h) name no parameters of span: a labelled tuple is applied by name
function span(x: int, y: int) returns int
    y * 10 - x

let r (w: 1, h: 2)
print "`span(r)`"
